  "description": "<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong>TreeBites Premium Chia Seeds</strong> are tiny, nutrient-rich seeds that make a simple and versatile addition to your everyday diet. With their mild flavour and easy-to-use nature, chia seeds can be incorporated into a variety of meals and beverages.<span class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\n<p>They can be soaked in water or milk, added to smoothies, yogurt, oatmeal and breakfast bowls, or sprinkled over salads and other dishes for an added nutritional boost.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Highlights:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Premium-quality chia seeds</li>\n<li>Naturally rich in dietary fibre</li>\n<li>Source of plant-based protein</li>\n<li>Contains omega-3 fatty acids</li>\n<li>Contains essential minerals</li>\n<li>Easy to incorporate into everyday meals</li>\n<li>Suitable for smoothies, breakfast bowls, yogurt and salads</li>\n<li>Convenient everyday superfood</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>How to Use:</strong><br>Soak chia seeds in water or your preferred beverage before consumption, or add them to smoothies, yogurt, oatmeal and other foods.</p>\n<p><strong>TreeBites — Nourishing Roots, Enriching Lives.</strong></p>",
